WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.084
In this fictional example, AI reduces drafting time by twenty minutes.

00:00:05.084 --> 00:00:09.705
But invented service promises require thirty extra minutes of correction.

00:00:09.705 --> 00:00:13.402
The full process now takes ten minutes longer.

00:00:13.402 --> 00:00:16.175
Draft speed is an activity measure.

00:00:16.175 --> 00:00:24.032
The useful business question is whether the final work improves after all review and rework are counted.
